<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Itau Seguros posts 42 mln real H1 net.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Itau Seguros posts 42 mln real H1 net.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian bank Banco Itau's insurance unit, Itau Seguros, released the following figures for 1996's first half.</p>
<p>			   H1 1996		  H1 1995</p>
<p>    Net		42.0 million	    57.5 million</p>
<p>    Premiums	420.6 million	   366.5 million</p>
<p>    Net worth	  1.009 bln	    865.8 bln</p>
<p>Note: All figures are in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>The figures for 1995's first half are inflation-adjusted, but those for this year's first six months are not.</p>
<p>-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 232 4411</p>
</text>
